dex.ts), and re-run \"yarn docs\" from the root of the turf project. -->\n\n---\n\nThis module is part of the [Turfjs project](https://turfjs.org/), an open source module collection dedicated to geographic algorithms. It is maintained in the [Turfjs/turf](https://github.com/Turfjs/turf) repository, where you can create PRs and issues.\n\n### Installation\n\nInstall this single module individually:\n\n```sh\n$ npm install @turf/centroid\n```\n\nOr install the all-encompassing @turf/turf module that includes all modules as functions:\n\n```sh\n$ npm install @turf/turf\n```\n","time":{"created":"2022-01-26T21:04:25.127Z","modified":"2026-08-03T15:29:38.697Z","6.5.0":"2021-07-10T10:17:34.654Z","6.4.0":"2021-06-17T13:30:47.417Z","6.3.0":"2021-01-20T14:39:18.529Z","6.2.0":"2021-01-12T14:57:18.660Z","6.2.0-alpha.3":"2020-12-10T21:04:40.649Z","6.2.0-alpha.2":"2020-07-13T14:40:13.749Z","6.2.0-alpha.1":"2020-03-27T00:01:41.844Z","6.2.0-alpha.0":"2020-03-26T22:35:20.295Z","6.0.2":"2018-04-04T13:06:19.342Z","6.0.0":"2018-02-23T23:17:44.019Z","5.1.5":"2017-12-10T05:11:07.845Z","5.1.0":"2017-12-07T19:25:41.429Z","5.0.4":"2017-11-09T17:48:22.437Z","4.7.3":"2017-09-12T13:21:17.636Z","4.7.1":"2017-09-05T15:36:00.492Z","4.7.0":"2017-09-05T15:29:59.972Z","4.6.1":"2017-08-02T17:04:29.970Z","4.6.0":"2017-08-02T16:57:32.104Z","4.5.2":"2017-06-30T17:23:09.733Z","4.5.1":"2017-06-30T17:07:07.778Z","4.5.0":"2017-06-30T16:56:38.323Z","4.4.0":"2017-06-06T01:52:22.656Z","4.3.0":"2017-05-12T02:04:21.538Z","4.2.0":"2017-04-30T21:46:55.520Z","4.1.0":"2017-04-10T14:39:02.677Z","4.0.2":"2017-04-06T16:24:40.098Z","4.0.1":"2017-04-05T22:50:50.100Z","4.0.0":"2017-04-03T00:31:05.750Z","3.14.0":"2017-03-22T15:52:01.358Z","3.13.0":"2017-03-12T05:01:21.098Z","3.10.5":"2017-03-02T21:28:00.574Z","3.10.4":"2017-02-28T13:37:34.751Z","3.10.3":"2017-02-20T20:55:32.659Z","3.10.0":"2017-02-14T20:29:37.237Z","3.7.5":"2017-01-23T01:16:42.514Z","3.7.3":"2017-01-09T16:59:42.035Z","3.7.2":"2017-01-09T16:56:59.307Z","3.